.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH PDFLUENT-WATERMARK 1  "pdfluent 1.1.0" PDFluent
.SH NAME
pdfluent\-watermark \- Add a text or image watermark across all pages
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpdfluent watermark\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-out\fR> [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-text\fR] [\fB\-\-image\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-position\fR] [\fB\-\-at\fR] [\fB\-\-rotate\fR] [\fB\-\-opacity\fR] [\fB\-\-layer\fR] [\fB\-\-font\-size\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-width\fR] [\fB\-\-height\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIINPUT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a text or image watermark across all pages
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON envelope on stdout
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-out\fR \fI<OUT>\fR
Output PDF, or `\-` for stdout
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Quiet: human mode prints data only (no warnings or progress notes)
.TP
\fB\-\-text\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
Watermark text (exactly one of \-\-text/\-\-image)
.TP
\fB\-\-image\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Watermark image (PNG or JPEG; exactly one of \-\-text/\-\-image)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Verbose stderr diagnostics (repeat for more)
.TP
\fB\-\-position\fR \fI<POSITION>\fR [default: center]
Placement on the page
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
center: Centred (default)
.IP \(bu 2
top\-left: Top\-left corner
.IP \(bu 2
top\-right: Top\-right corner
.IP \(bu 2
bottom\-left: Bottom\-left corner
.IP \(bu 2
bottom\-right: Bottom\-right corner
.IP \(bu 2
exact: Exact coordinates (needs `\-\-at X,Y`)
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-at\fR \fI<X,Y>\fR
Coordinates in PDF points: inset from the corner for corner placements (default `36,36`), absolute for `exact` (required)
.TP
\fB\-\-rotate\fR \fI<ROTATE>\fR [default: 0]
Rotation in degrees (text only)
.TP
\fB\-\-opacity\fR \fI<OPACITY>\fR [default: 0.5]
Opacity from 0 (invisible) to 1 (opaque)
.TP
\fB\-\-layer\fR \fI<LAYER>\fR [default: foreground]
Foreground or background placement (text only)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
foreground: In front of the content
.IP \(bu 2
background: Behind the content
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-font\-size\fR \fI<FONT_SIZE>\fR [default: 48]
Font size in points (text only)
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<COLOR>\fR [default: 999999]
Text colour as RRGGBB hex (text only)
.TP
\fB\-\-width\fR \fI<WIDTH>\fR
Image display width in points (image only; default scales the image to half the page width, keeping its aspect)
.TP
\fB\-\-height\fR \fI<HEIGHT>\fR
Image display height in points (image only; default keeps aspect)
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Overwrite the existing output file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIINPUT\fR>
Input PDF, or `\-` for stdin
.SH VERSION
v1.1.0
